# PR governance preflight

For pull request, issue, review, or remediation work, read `.agents/skills/lgfc-pr-governance/SKILL.md` and `.github/pull_request_template.md` before opening or updating a pull request. Cursor pull requests also read `docs/how-to/cursor/open-task-pr.md`.

This rule routes to those documents. It does not add a second pull-request rule. An unapproved Cursor workaround is denied.
